	(descr "Same Sky / CUI SJ-43514 (SJ-43515TS with tip switch fits: hole 5 provided as NPTH), 3.5 mm 4-conductor (TRRS) right-angle PCB jack, plastic bushing (isolated from panel). Pads from the SJ-4351X drawing rev 1.06 (2024-09-12): S=pin1 sleeve, T=pin2 tip, R1=pin3 ring 1, R2=pin4 ring 2; two 1.0 mm locating pegs on the axis. PCB edge / body front at y=0; bushing protrudes 3.0 mm. The drawing asks for a 1.3 mm deep x 4.5 mm wide notch in the board edge centred on the axis (shown on F.Fab); pins 3/5 depth (10.8) is scaled from the drawing, not dimensioned - verify.")
